  "merger_description": "Parker-Hannifin Corporation (Parker-Hannifin) proposes to acquire the Aerospace and Defense business of CIRCOR International, Inc. (CIRCOR A&D).\n\nParker-Hannifin is a global engineering company headquartered in the United States. It designs, manufactures and supplies motion and control technologies and systems, and provides engineered solutions for a variety of mobile, industrial and aerospace applications.\n\nCIRCOR A&D designs, manufactures and supports flight-critical motion and flow control products for commercial aircraft and defence applications with manufacturing and operational locations in the United States, France and Morocco.\n\nParker-Hannifin and CIRCOR A&D both supply fluid control valves for industrial applications in Australia.",
